1037 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (The Edge-AI Condition Monitoring Node provides an effective solution for predictive maintenance of industrial induction motors. It uses an ESP32-S3 SoC, a 3-axis MEMS accelerometer, FreeRTOS, a quantized CNN model and MQTT communication. )
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
1038 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (The proposed system collects vibration data, processes it locally, identifies abnormal motor conditions and sends fault alerts to a plant gateway. DMA-based acquisition and real-time task scheduling help achieve deterministic processing. )
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [31]
>>
endobj
1039 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 199 0 R
/T (The design provides a foundation for intelligent industrial monitoring, reduced maintenance costs and early fault detection. However, final deployment approval depends on successful hardware testing, model validation, timing analysis and power measurements. )
